{"3928200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Horror in the forest", "steam_appid": 3928200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The quiet forest is no longer safe. Too much has gone wrong — and now, together with your companion, you must uncover what hides among the trees. Every step feels heavy. The silence is broken only by rustling leaves and someone else's footsteps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928200/extras/4d897f4566032a1925e1a2d01d1091d9.poster.avif?t=1755772752\" width=616 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928200/extras/4d897f4566032a1925e1a2d01d1091d9.webm?t=1755772752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928200/extras/4d897f4566032a1925e1a2d01d1091d9.mp4?t=1755772752\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only two of you. No one else volunteered. The mission: find out where the zombies come from. But the deeper you go, the clearer it becomes — this won’t be simple. The radio goes silent. Supplies run low. And the truth lies deeper than expected. Only focus, endurance, and persistence will get you through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928200/extras/642fcf59e1006bcb41f66a60e2fba99c.poster.avif?t=1755772752\" width=650 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928200/extras/642fcf59e1006bcb41f66a60e2fba99c.webm?t=1755772752\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928200/ex